    {
      "name": "act",
      "docs": ["Keeper action: forward one allowlisted instruction (Raydium CLMM open/increase/decrease/swap/close, DBC swap2_with_transfer_hook on the bear pool, hooked redeem side 1, stake pool DepositSol/WithdrawSol pinned to the vault's accounts) signed by the vault PDA and its SOL sub-account. The first act in a transaction snapshots NAV, hedge error, D and fees owed and requires a settle for this vault later in the same transaction. Data after the tag is the inner instruction data verbatim."],
      "discriminator": [3],
      "accounts": [
