      "docs": ["Closes a rebalance: NAV >= snapshot * (1 - max_loss_bps) and hedge error <= band_bps or no worse than the snapshot. Pays the keeper keeper_bps of |ΔD| + harvested fees from the SOL sub-account."],
      "discriminator": [4],
